&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 42.5pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;For the years ended September 30, 2025 and 2024&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;, total sale proceeds were $170 and $916, respectively with minimal realized gains and realized losses. There were also no loss impairments of debt securities in these years. For the years ended September 30, 2025 and 2024, total purchases were $(306) and $(958), respectively.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
