&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 6.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;GMP&amp;#8217;s long&amp;#8209;term debt consists of the following:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
