&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;The First Mortgage Bonds that mature beyond 2030 have maturity dates that range between 2031 and 2053.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="WordSection11"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -21.25pt; line-height: 120%; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 27.0pt; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;(10)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;strong&gt;Asset Retirement Obligations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;GMP continually reviews the regulations, laws, and contractual obligations to which it is a party to identify situations where there are legal obligations to perform asset retirement activities. Through these reviews, GMP has identified certain easements that may obligate GMP to perform asset retirement activities at various generating facilities.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: lines-together; page-break-after: avoid; margin: 12.0pt 0in 6.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;Changes in the total carrying value of the asset retirement obligations for the years ended September 30, 2025 and 2024 are as follows:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div align="right"&gt;
