&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: lines-together; margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;" align="right"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -21.25pt; line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: lines-together; page-break-after: avoid; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 27.0pt; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;(23)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160; Subsequent Events&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;GMP considers events or transactions that occur after the balance sheet date, but before the financial statements are issued, to provide additional evidence relative to certain estimates or to identify matters that require additional disclosure. These financial statements were available to be issued on November 14, 2025 and subsequent events have been evaluated through that date.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 120%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 21.25pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;"&gt;The Company has evaluated subsequent events and transactions occurring after November 14, 2025 through December 16, 2025, the date of issuance of these financial statements.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;On December 3, 2025 GMP received first mortgage bonds for $60,000 and $40,000 due 2036 and 2038 at rates of 5.15% and 5.30% respectively.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;There were no other events or transactions that require adjustment to, or disclosure in, the financial statements as of and for the year ended September 30, 2025, with the exception of items otherwise disclosed in these financial statements.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 22.5pt; line-height: 112%;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
